        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2017 Wiley Periodicals, Inc.",
        "AbstractText": "Adverse drug reactions (ADRs) are a common problem in children. Health-related quality of life in patients with such conditions has not been well studied. In this study we found that health-related quality of life is adversely affected in children who developed ADRs with cutaneous manifestations."
